+ # DashPass — First-Time Setup
+ > This guide walks you through the one-time setup needed before using DashPass.
+ > Once complete, you won't need to read this file again.
+ ---
+ ---
+ ---
+ ---
+ ## Prerequisites Checklist
+ ### 1. Node.js 18 or newer
